1, "type": "audio", "id": 1, "title": "", "contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"audiosrc": "engenn8le08ob08re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn8le08ob08re2img01.jpg", "images": [{"image": "engenn8le08ob08re2img01.jpg", "text": "", "time": "0", "id": 0}, {"image": "engenn8le08ob08re2img01.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Justin</span>: Fancy meeting you here!\n<br /><span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Hi Justin.  I haven't seen you for ages.  How's the family?\n<br /><span class=\"strong\">Justin</span>: Pam and the twins are great. They started primary school last month. We had thought they might not be ready but they are enjoying their new routine. What about you?\n<br /><span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Actually, I'm waiting for my date to arrive ...", "time": "100", "id": 1}, {"image": "engenn8le08ob08re2img02.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Justin</span>: Still on the dating scene, eh? How long have you been waiting?\n<br /><span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Half an hour. She must be trying to tell me something.\n<br /><span class=\"strong\">Justin</span>: Oh don't say that. She might be stuck in traffic. It's a zoo after work.\n<br /><span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Maybe ...\n<br /><span class=\"strong\">Justin</span>: Or it may be the weather if she is using public transport. I heard that the subway is delayed due to water on the tracks at Bloom Station.  How well do you know her?", "time": "20250", "id": 2}, {"image": "engenn8le08ob08re2img05.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: This is only our second time out together. Come to think of it, she was an hour late for our first date too! We had tickets to a baseball game and missed the first five innings. The game had almost ended before she sauntered in.\n<br /><span class=\"strong\">Justin</span>: Ouch! If I had waited for an hour and a half, there would not have been another date.  And you still invited her out a second time?\n<br /><span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: I thought I might give her another chance. She's in the same field and highly ambitious.  Plus, she's very attractive.\n<br /><span class=\"strong\">Justin</span>: Well, I'm meeting up with friends for drinks and to watch the NFL playoffs on the big screen. You must join us!", "time": "44950", "id": 3}, {"image": "engenn8le08ob08re2img05.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Thanks buddy! I might sit here near the door for a bit.  I'm starting to think that I'll be spending the evening with the guys. Pretty or not, making someone wait is just plain rude.\n<br /><span class=\"strong\">Justin</span>: I'll shout you a drink ...  WAITER.\n<br /><span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Oh here she comes now. 45 minutes late? I wonder what the excuse will be this time.", "time": "83000", "id": 4}]}}], "_data": []}, {"template_override": 1, "type": "video", "id": 2, "title": "", "contents": [{"type": "video", "value": {"video_src": "engenn8le08ob08re3vid01", "images": [{"image": "", "text": "", "time": "0", "id": 0}, {"image": "", "text": "Manners and Customs", "time": "5000", "id": 1}, {"image": "", "text": "<span class=\"bullet\">What customs are important in America?</span>", "time": "26800", "id": 2}, {"image": "", "text": "<span class=\"bullet\">What customs are important in your country?</span>", "time": "87000", "id": 3}, {"image": "", "text": "<span class=\"bullet\">Topic sentence</span>", "time": "101000", "id": 4}, {"image": "", "text": "<span class=\"bullet\">Supporting sentences</span>", "time": "120000", "id": 5}, {"image": "", "text": "<span class=\"bullet\">Concluding sentence</span>", "time": "137000", "id": 6}]}}], "_data": []}], "_data": [{"type": "lab_options", "contents": [{"content": true, "type": "has_nav"}, {"content": true, "type": "has_exercise_controls"}]}], "id": 0}], "type": "sena"}